== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[fjörutíu]]'' meaning "[[forty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[six]]'' "[[sex]]". Meaning '''forty and six'''.
=== Cardinal number ===
'''fjörutíu og sex''' {{indecl}}

# [[forty-six]], cardinal number after [[fjörutíu og fimm]] and before [[fjörutíu og sjö]]

